---
description: Use Command Prompt syntax for this Windows-operated repository
alwaysApply: true
---

On Windows, use `cmd.exe` and Command Prompt-compatible commands by default.
Use PowerShell only when the task requires it. Avoid POSIX environment assignments,
`export`, and `#` inline comments in executable cmd examples. Use the repository's
pnpm scripts.

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for shared policy and read
[AGENT_START_HERE](../../docs/AGENT_START_HERE.md) before non-trivial work.
